.TH SQUIRT 1
.SH NAME
squirt \- hose and droplet toy
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/squirt
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Squirt
is a hose and droplet toy.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Aim the hose nozzle with wasd or the arrows; droplets spray under the mass-spring solver.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B arrows / wasd
Move nozzle
.TP
.B Enter
Restart
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/squirt.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR draw3d (2),
.IR ode (2),
.IR tone (2),
.IR wm (1)
